      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "マードル殿のことがおれにはどうも引っかかる。\n彼の情報を集めることを君にも協力してほしい。\n街で聞き込みを行って十分な情報が集まったら、\nおれのところに来てほしい。",
        "official_en": "Something about Father Mahdel bothers me, and I'd\nlike your help gathering intel. Once you have gone\naround the city and gathered enough information,\ncome find me.",
        "real_en": "Something about Mardle-dono bothers me, and I'd\nlike your help gathering intel. Once you have gone\naround the city and gathered enough information,\ncome find me."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
