      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "ご苦労だった。思っていたよりも情報が集まったな。\nやはりマードル殿に何かあるらしいことは分かった。\n後は、引き続き、おれたちカーラ神殿のほうで\n調査は続行しよう。",
        "official_en": "Good work. You gathered much more intel than I'd\nexpected. There's something more to what happened\nwith Father Mahdel after all. Those of us at Kalla's\ntemple will continue investigating.",
        "real_en": "Good work. You gathered much more intel than I'd\nexpected. There's something more to what happened\nwith Mardle-dono after all. Those of us at Cara's\ntemple will continue investigating."
      },
